        "text": ".. _websdkcontrol.lazyloaddependencies:\n\n----\n\n.. rst-class:: forsearch\n\nWebSDKControl.LazyLoadDependencies\n\n**LazyLoadDependencies** As :doc:`Boolean</api/data_types/boolean>`\n\n  This is a method that can be overridden by subclasses. By default it returns :doc:`False</api/language/false>`. Returning :doc:`True</api/language/true>` will lazy load CSS and JS dependencies for that control. If it's :doc:`False</api/language/false>` or the method hasn't been overridden, it won't do any lazy loading, everything will be downloaded when the framework creates the Session for that user.\n",
